age link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-8d966718ce6f9f44END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-531ede37806fdd1aEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_JewelryShop_JewelsBrochure</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_JewelryShop_JewelsBrochure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_JewelryShop_JewelsBrochure\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">8eb14f02-ad67-49a0-86ed-b16bbb24d049</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8eb14f02-ad67-49a0-86ed-b16bbb24d049\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8eb14f02-ad67-49a0-86ed-b16bbb24d049\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/The_Glitter_Gala\" title=\"The Glitter Gala\">The Glitter Gala</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-178&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-64</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A brochure featuring several of the city's patriars wearing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Omotola\" title=\"Omotola\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Portrait_Omotola.png/25px-Portrait_Omotola.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Portrait_Omotola.png/38px-Portrait_Omotola.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Portrait_Omotola.png/50px-Portrait_Omotola.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Omotola's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Portrait_Omotola.png/25px-Portrait_Omotola.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Portrait_Omotola.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Omotola\" title=\"Omotola\">Omotola's</a> gems. On the front page is a detailed drawing of a large and ornate wedding ring. Underneath, are the words 'Designed by the <a href=\"/wiki/Glitter_Gala\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Glitter Gala\">Glitter Gala</a>. Commmisioned by Lady <a href=\"/wiki/Fireliia_Jannath\" title=\"Fireliia Jannath\">Fireliia Jannath</a>.'\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202335\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1865/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31851/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8072/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936876/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.946      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   45.946      1 -total\n 55.99%   25.723      8 Template:Icon_text\n 49.66%   22.815     19 Template:Trim\n 21.98%   10.097      2 Template:Uid\n 15.34%    7.047      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.66%    6.735      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.43%    5.711      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.35%    4.755      8 Template:Ifempty\n  9.90%    4.549      1 Template:Ifexist\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31704-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202335 and revision id 377891. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}